OpenDecoDesk Stitch Analyzer

This program includes third-party software:

- Embroidery file readers (stitch_analyzer/web/readers.js) — the machine-file record layouts, the .hus
  decompressor and the machine makers' thread color charts are ported from pyembroidery (EmbroidePy),
  by way of OpenDecoDesk's public/admin-stitch.js. The DSZ layout in stitch_analyzer/web/formats.js
  follows pyembroidery's DszReader. scripts/make_reader_fixtures.py uses pyembroidery to write test files.
  Source: https://github.com/EmbroidePy/pyembroidery

